    'content' => '<p>Some hairstyles are forever in fashion, and a classic never goes out of style. A straight blow-dry is exactly one of those styles. Its beauty is that it draws attention in the most discreet way, hair that looks tidy, elegant, healthy and groomed on any occasion.</p>
