    'content' => '<p>A wavy blow-dry has been one of the favourite styles for a groomed, modern look for years. Waves give the hair movement, fullness and softness, while keeping a natural look that suits almost any occasion. Whether you are going to work, a meeting, dinner or a celebration, well-shaped waves look elegant, but never overly styled.</p>
<p>Unlike completely straight hair or pronounced curls, waves are the perfect balance between a natural and a polished look. That is exactly why they have not gone out of fashion for years and are often the first choice of women who want hair that looks groomed, airy and full of life.</p>
<p>Although they look spontaneous, natural waves are no accident. A beautiful result comes from the right blow-dry technique, experience and adapting to each hair type. Length, density, the cut and the natural texture all affect how the waves will look and how long they will hold their shape.</p>
